    - Disable app self-update and yt-dlp runtime executable updates to comply with IzzyOnDroid policies.
    - Configure release signing using environment variables for secure CI builds.
    - Refine backup and data extraction rules to exclude device-specific community identity data.
    - Update version catalog and move hardcoded dependencies to libs.versions.toml.
    - Clean up distribution-sensitive logic and unused imports in MainActivity and Retr0Installer.

